  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Authors in Iran have tried to form an independent union of writers and been met by repression and persecution. In order to get information and create opinion the Swedish Union of Writers and Reporters has plannned to organize a conference in Stocholm during 1999, but this conference was not possible to organize.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Konferensen inst&#xe4;lld av s&#xe4;kerhetssk&#xe4;l. Resor f&#xf6;r iranska exilf&#xf6;rfattarutbetalats med SEK 7 770). Resten skall &#xe5;terbetalas till Sida SEK 25 230.</narrative>
